{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/760422-w20-looking-for-players","id":760422,"title":"[W20] Looking for players","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-07T19:44:28-08:00","id":760422,"title":"[W20] Looking for players","content":"Hey everyone.<br /> <br /> I'm looking for one to three players for a short werewolf game. It'll be set during the character's rite of passage, amidst political intrigue and some good 'ole savage horror. Heavy on the roleplaying, but with a good mix of combat thrown in.<br /> <br /> My zone is EST, but since I don't feel too comfortable speaking I'd prefer to play over Skype text chat or through another play-by-post forum (RPOL, Myth Weavers, etc.). I should be able to post daily to every other day.<br /> <br /> Please shoot me a PM if you're interested -- thanks!<br /> <hr /><b>System:</b> Werewolf: the Apocalypse 20th Anniversary Edition<br /> <b>Restrictions:</b> Garou only. No kinfolk or Changing Breeds. <br /> <b>Breed:</b> Open. Lupus will be scrutinized. I'm leery of Metis - I find them difficult to play well. <br /> <b>Tribe:</b> Open.<br /> <br /> No eating each other -- you don't have to like your packmates, you might even thrash one another occasionally -- but at the end of the day, you must have their back. Your character needs to be able to work in a diverse pack.<br /> <br /> We'll be starting with their First Change. The setting is the fictional Coalridge, Wyoming, a failing oil 'boom town' near the border of Yellowstone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/542-witch","name":"Witch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-15T14:10:06-08:00","id":766525,"title":"","content":"Still looking for players.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/542-witch","name":"Witch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-15T23:27:56-08:00","id":766875,"title":"","content":"I would like to learn more about this, could def do a play by post and maybe a skype or what not if the days fall on my off days.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9425-grouchygrizzly","name":"GrouchyGrizzly","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-16T09:18:39-08:00","id":767117,"title":"","content":"Heh, why not. I think skype text chat could work better since almost every play by post game I've been in ended up dying, but I'm game for both medium. My time zone is CET, if it matters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-17T12:36:13-08:00","id":768021,"title":"","content":"Great, happy to see some inte